"""Reviewed external translations for module summaries/descriptions."""

MODULE_METADATA_TRANSLATIONS = (
    ('Author', '作者'),
    ('Website', '网站'),
    ('License', '许可证'),
    ('Credits', '鸣谢'),
    ('Advanced ramping and exposure control for the intervalometer', '为间隔拍摄提供高级渐变和曝光控制。'),
    ('Advanced ramping and exposure control for the intervalometer\n\nCreate keyframes from current camera settings and specify the\nframe at which the keyframe is applied. You will select which\nparameters you would like to set in the keyframe and which you\nwould like to ignore. The module ramps (linearly) the vaules of\nselected parameters from one keyframe to the next while the\nintervalometer is running.\n\n\n', '可把当前相机设置保存为关键帧，并选择需要控制的参数。间隔拍摄运行时，会在关键帧之间平滑改变曝光、对焦位置和拍摄间隔；设置序列还可以保存后再次使用。'),
    ('A stripped-down version of the old 1980s brick breaker-style\ngame "Arkanoid". Use LEFT and RIGHT keys (or joystick) to play.\n\nArkanoid is an old arcade game developed in 1986 in the spirit of\nAtari\'s Breakout game from the 1970s. The game is pretty\nstraight forward: you have a paddle (it\'s actually your ship) and\nyou have to keep a ball from falling off the screen by bouncing it\nup and destroying the blocks in your way (from PetaPixel).\n\nTip: with an actor in the scene on hard difficulty (for example\nwhilst playing during a paid shoot) the game becomes much\nmore challenging but no less enjoyable (from EOSHD).\n\n', '一个精简的经典打砖块游戏。使用左右方向键或摇杆移动挡板，接住小球并清除砖块。'),
    ('Auto exposure algorithm', '按预设曲线自动控制曝光。'),
    ("Automatic exposure algorithm based on predefined curves. It's\nlike a real 'P' where you actually program what you want the\ncamera to do depending on the light.\nhttp://www.magiclantern.fm/forum/?topic=7208\n\n", '按照预设曲线自动调整曝光。它提供可编程的 P 模式，可根据环境亮度改变快门、光圈和 ISO 的组合。'),
    ('Benchmarks (speed tests)', '存储卡、内存和功能速度测试。'),
    ('Benchmarks (speed tests):\n\n *  card benchmarks\n *  memory benchmarks\n *  various feature benchmarks\n\nIn particular, the quick card benchmark is useful for diagnosing\nspeed issues when recording RAW video.\n\n', '提供存储卡、内存以及部分相机功能的性能测试。快速存储卡测试可帮助判断 RAW 录像速度异常是否由存储卡造成。'),
    ('Turn the 1080p and 720p video modes into 1:1 sensor crop modes', '把 1080p/720p 模式改为 1:1 传感器裁切。'),
    ("This alters the 1080p and 720p video modes, transforming them\ninto 3x (1:1) crop modes, by tweaking the sensor registers.\n\nAll other behaviors are the same as with Canon's 1080p/720p\nimplementation: resolution, H.264, RAW, audio, HDMI, preview,\noverlays and so on.\n\n", '通过调整传感器寄存器，把部分 1080p/720p 录像模式改为约 3 倍的 1:1 像素裁切模式。H.264、RAW、声音、HDMI、预览和叠加显示等功能仍按原方式工作。'),
    ('Post deflicker sidecar files', '生成用于后期去闪烁的附属文件。'),
    ('Generate sidecar (XMP/UFRaw) files for post deflicking.\n\n', '为照片生成 XMP 或 UFRaw 附属文件，便于在后期处理中校正延时摄影等序列的亮度闪烁。'),
    ('Autofocus fine-tuning.', '自动进行 Dot-Tune 对焦微调校准。'),
    ('An automated version of the Dot-Tune focus tuning method.\n\nhttp://youtu.be/7zE50jCUPhM\n\n', '自动执行 Dot-Tune 对焦测试，用于寻找并设置较合适的自动对焦微调值。'),
    ('Dynamic range improvement by using two ISOs in one picture', '在同一张照片中使用两档 ISO 提升动态范围。'),
    ('Increases dynamic range by sampling the sensor at two different\nISOs, switching ISO for every other line pair. This trick cleans up\nshadow noise, resulting in a dynamic range improvement of\naround 3 stops, at the cost of reduced vertical resolution,\naliasing and moire.\n\nWorks for both raw photos (CR2) and raw videos (DNG). You need\nto postprocess these files with a tool called **cr2hdr**.\n\nAfter postprocessing, you will get a DNG that looks like a dark ISO\n100 shot, but you can bring the exposure back up and be\ndelighted by how little noise is present in those recovered\nshadows.\n\n\n', '让相邻行组交替使用两档 ISO，可获得更干净的暗部并提升约 3 档动态范围，但会损失部分垂直分辨率，也可能产生锯齿或摩尔纹。拍摄的 CR2/DNG 需要用 cr2hdr 后期处理。'),
    ('EDMAC reverse engineering and diagnostic tools.', 'EDMAC 逆向分析与诊断工具。'),
    ('EDMAC reverse engineering and diagnostic tools.\n\n', '供开发者分析和诊断相机的 EDMAC 数据传输系统。普通拍摄不需要启用此模块；不熟悉其用途时请保持关闭。'),
    ('Expose To The Right - auto exposure that minimizes noise', '自动向右曝光，在不过曝的前提下降低噪点。'),
    ('ETTR is a techinque that optimizes your exposure for raw\nshooting, with the goal of minimizing noise without blowing the\nhighlights.\n\nAuto ETTR will adjust the exposure for you until the histogram will\ntouch the right side, but - whenever possible - without clipping.\nThis will minimize image noise for your given set of restrictions\n(e.g. slowest shutter, max ISO, or what highlights can be clipped).\n\nYou will usually have to darken the image in post (which is good).\n\nTip: on the raw histogram you will see an ETTR hint that can be\nused for manually exposing the image.\n\n', '在设定的快门和 ISO 限制内自动调整曝光，使 RAW 直方图尽量靠右且不剪切高光，从而减少噪点。照片通常需要在后期处理中适当压暗。'),
    ('File manager (browse the files on the card)', '浏览和管理存储卡上的文件。'),
    ('Browse the card filesystem from ML menu.\n\nFeatures:\n\n *  Display file name, size and date\n *  Select files (individual or by extension)\n *  Copy and move files\n *  Delete files\n *  View files (text viewer built-in, other file types via custom\n    handlers)\n\n', '浏览存储卡文件并查看名称、大小和日期。可以选择、复制、移动、删除或打开支持的文件。'),
    ("Customize Canon's image file naming (IMG_1234.CR2 -> ABCD1234.CR2)", '自定义佳能照片文件名和编号。'),
    ('This module lets you customize image file names:\n\n *  custom file prefix (IMG_1234.CR2 -> ABCD1234.CR2)\n *  change file number (IMG_1234.CR2 -> IMG_5678.CR2; requires\n    restart)\n *  change folder number (DCIM/100CANON -> 123CANON)\n\nYou will find the new options under the Shoot menu.\n\n', '可修改照片文件名前缀、文件编号和文件夹编号。相关选项位于拍摄菜单中；重新设置编号前请确认不会产生重名文件。'),
    ('Module for running Lua scripts on the camera.\n\nThe scripting engine looks for scripts (*.LUA) in ML/SCRIPTS. Any\nscripts found get "loaded" at startup by the scripting engine\nsimply running them. Therefore the main body of the script\nshould simply _define_ the script\'s menu and behavior, not\nactually _execute_ anything.\n\nThe scripting engine will maintain your script\'s global state from\nrun to run, so any global variables you declare will persist until\nthe camera is turned off.\n\nAPI documentation: http://davidmilligan.github.io/ml-lua/\n\n', '运行 ML/SCRIPTS 文件夹中的 .LUA 脚本。脚本在启动时加载，其全局状态会保留到相机关闭。'),
    ('Records 14-bit RAW video', '录制 14 位 RAW 视频。'),
    ('Records 14-bit RAW video.\n\nThis is the original RAW recording module updated to MLV file\nformat (credits: dmilligan), but without the extra features from\nmlv_rec. The performance should be identical to the old raw_rec\nv1.0.\n\nYou may want to load mlv_play for reviewing clips.\n\nFor details, please see the "Raw Video" section on the Magic\nLantern forum.\n\n', '原始 RAW 录像模块的 MLV 文件格式版本，不包含 mlv_rec 的额外功能，性能应与旧版 raw_rec v1.0 接近。若要在相机中查看片段，可同时加载 mlv_play。'),
    ('Play MLV/RAW', '播放 MLV/RAW 视频。'),
    ('Plays Magic Lantern video files (both MLV and RAW). You can\nselect videos for playback in the file_man module, or you can\npress the PLAY key in LV to play the most recent recording.\n\n *  "all": play every video frame\n *  "exact": drop video frames to match recorded FPS\n\nKeys:\n\n *  SET: use the on-screen menu\n *  PLAY: pause or resume playback\n *  INFO: toggle display of video information\n *  wheel: switch to previous or next video\n\n', '用于在相机中播放 MLV 和 RAW 视频。可在文件管理器中选择片段，也可在实时取景界面按播放键打开最近的片段。'),
    ('Adds sound recording functionality to mlv_rec', '为 MLV 录像增加声音录制支持。'),
    ('With this module, mlv_rec is extended by sound recording\nsupport.\n\n', '为 MLV 录像模块增加音频录制功能。录音可用性和采样方式取决于相机型号及当前录像模块。'),
    ('Image viewer that integrates with the file manager.', '配合文件管理器查看图片。'),
    ('Simple image viewer that integrates with ML file manager\n(file_man.mo).\n\nUsage: browse the file system with the file manager, select an\nimage file and choose View.\n\nSupported file types:\n\n *  PPM (ML screenshots)\n *  DNG (silent pictures, raw video frames)\n *  BMP (bitmap images with DryOS palette, uncompressed or RLE)\n *  BMH (ML help files, same as BMP)\n *  422 (YUV422 images, e.g. dumps from LiveView buffer)\n\n', '可查看文件管理器中选中的 PPM、DNG、BMP、BMH 和 422 图片文件。'),
    ('Stability tests', '内部稳定性和自检程序。'),
    ('Testing routines for ML internals:\n\n *  stubs tests\n *  memory tests\n *  various burn-in tests\n\nPlease run these tests every now and then; when they fail,\nplease report a bug.\n\n', '包含存根、内存和长时间运行等内部测试，用于开发及稳定性检查。普通拍摄不需要启用；若测试失败，请记录详细信息后反馈。'),
    ('Take pictures in LiveView without shutter actuation', '在实时取景中拍摄照片而不动作机械快门。'),
    ('Take pictures in LiveView without shutter actuations. Format:\n14-bit DNG, low-resolution, depending on LiveView mode (1080p,\n720p, zoom and so on).\n\nYou may want to load pic_view & file_man for reviewing pictures.\n\nModes:\n\n *  Simple: press the shutter halfway to take a picture.\n *  Burst: take pictures until memory gets full, then save to card.\n *  End Trigger: take pics continuously, save last few pics to card.\n *  Best Shots: take pics continuously, save the best (focused) pics.\n *  Slit-Scan: distorted pictures for funky effects.\n\n', '从实时取景缓冲区保存低分辨率 DNG，拍摄时无需动作机械快门。支持单张、连拍、结束触发、最佳画面和狭缝扫描等模式；可配合 pic_view 和 file_man 查看文件。'),
)
